<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I found a cool frisbee in the park,</l><l>Hurrah! Hurrah!</l><l>It is neon blue, glows in the dark,</l><l>Hurrah! Hurrah!</l><l>Mike and Jane said “this is your lucky day;</l><l>Don’t tell your mom and you’ll be okay.”</l><l>Should I keep the frisbee? Should I just make it mine?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>But we are not “finders keepers” here,</l><l>No way! No way!</l><l>We choose to do what is right whatever friends would say.</l><l>Anything not ours we will never keep;</l><l>To our conscience daily we’ll take heed.</l><l>Hallelujah, we can be children of the light!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
